`s 2 senior officer` MEANS
    IF `the organization is a body corporate` AND `the person is a director, or the chief executive officer or the chief financial officer, of the body corporate`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE IF `the person plays an important role in the establishment of the organization’s policies` OR `the person is responsible for managing an important aspect of the organization’s activities`
         THEN `the person is a representative, by s 2 representative`   -- JUST TRUE; JUST FALSE for "means a representative who" unmet; NOTHING if s 2 representative is itself not covered
         ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "senior officer means a representative who plays an important role in the establishment of an organization’s policies or is responsible for managing an important aspect of the organization’s activities"

